WEBVTT

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:10.330
<i>What the heck did I just unseal?</i>

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:15.410
<i>I'm losing it... It's fading...</i>

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.140
<i>I'm forgetting everything about myself...</i>

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:24.790
<i>The joy of singing, the memories of the 
stages I stood on with Carmina...</i>

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.680
Carmina?

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:39.760
Carmina is my... my...

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:42.810
Who... am I?

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:50.520
<b></b>Menu 7<b>  The Prankster Pixie</b> 
 ~Cuore in the Mist~

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.700
Hey! You there!

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:05.090
No spacing out! Get to work!

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:10.210
Yuuki! Let's all go eat 
once we're done here!

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.760
Okay!

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.140
I'm so hungry.

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:20.190
We worked up a good morning sweat.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:27.550
Race you to the Cockatrice's Nest!

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:29.970
Last one there pays for everyone!

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.540
Yay!

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.890
Hey! Who said you could just decide that?!

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:37.020
Yay!

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:39.100
Meep!

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.460
Yuuki!

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:45.110
Was that a monster?!

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:49.990
Help!

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:56.750
Thank you for helping us!

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:59.600
Sorry about that, sonny.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:02.850
We were trying to run off some 
bees and got you instead.

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:04.510
It's okay.

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:06.650
I'm Ayane.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:08.990
This is Pukichi.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:11.720
So, what, you're a ventriloquist?

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:12.920
No!

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:16.250
Me and Pukichi are as close as family!

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:17.960
O-Okay...

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.570
And...

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.400
Who might this be?

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:28.740
Don't hide. You need to introduce yourself.

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:36.770
N-N-Nice to meet you.

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:38.210
I'm Kurumi.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.750
There you go! Good job!

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:43.420
I'm Pecorine.

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:46.760
I'm Karyl.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.550
My name is Kokkoro.

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:49.720
Yuuki.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:54.900
We went into the forest hoping 
to find some fresh honey, but...

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:54.900
There.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:58.890
You messed with the hive 
and they got you back for it?

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:03.160
Well, I still think you 
did your best, Ayane.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.910
Especially since you hate bugs.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.880
But I wasn't able to get any honey.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:10.990
Why did you want honey?

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:17.070
W-We've been staying at a place 
called the Sarendia Orphanage...

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.520
With Miss Saren?

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:20.650
You know Mama Saren?

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:22.890
She did a lot for me, as well.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:25.050
Oh, really?!

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:32.640
The thing is, Mama Saren 
just opened a new store...

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.670
And since she works so hard 
for all of us all the time,

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:42.710
we wanted to make her some hot 
lemonade with fresh honey.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:47.700
You definitely sound like kids 
from the Sarendia Orphanage.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:50.160
You're just lovely!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.090
Hey, come on.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:55.250
You just met the poor kids. 
Don't freak them out.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.870
You never change, do you?

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.130
<b>PriConne</b>

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:04.510
Since you're here, you should eat with us.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.330
We know a great place called 
the Cockatrice's Nest.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.910
Wow, can't wait to see it!

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:11.930
Yeah!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:20.830
Chika!

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:21.900
Miss Chika!

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:25.060
Hey, are you okay?

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:29.530
What happened, Miss Chika?

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.090
Chika?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.820
Who's that?

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:33.800
Huh?

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:35.910
I...

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.240
don't know who I am.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:42.200
I'm forgetting... It's fading...

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:42.990
I'm scared!

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.500
It's coming... It's coming!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:45.850
It's gonna...

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:51.850
Miss Chika!

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:55.650
What in the world...?

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:58.640
That's Chika from Carmina!

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:01.150
Thank you for helping, Master.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:06.260
Judging by her abnormal behavior earlier,

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.980
this is no mere sickness.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:11.630
It seemed like she was scared of something.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:16.670
You'll like it.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.730
Th-Thank you...

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:23.040
You think that lady we found 
will be okay, Ayane?

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:27.470
No, no! Not "Ayane"! 
Call me "Big Sis Ayane"!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.820
O-Okay...

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:32.440
It's just that you don't seem 
much like a big sister...

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:40.050
Well, yeah, Ayane is basically a kid.

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:42.060
It's hard to think of her 
as an "older" anything.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.770
You too, Pukichi?!

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:47.410
Ugh! You always say more than you need to!

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.780
I'm gonna throw you out on the 
next non-burnable garbage day!

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:56.410
Huh?

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.430
It was just a joke, Pukichi.

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:01.070
You know I'd never do that.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:06.020
I'm sorry, Pukichi!

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:11.520
I won't say dumb things like 
that again! Please answer me!

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:11.810
It really is ventriloquism, isn't it?

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:14.310
I brought her.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:15.540
Chika!

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:16.550
Miss Nozomi.

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:19.530
Nozomi, too?!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.230
<b>PriConne</b>

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:26.210
I healed her wounds with 
healing magic, but...

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:31.030
She did ask for some time off 
until our next concert,

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:34.000
but I never imagined it would lead to this.

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:35.950
Chika...

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:41.750
They're all really upset, Ayane.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.490
Pukichi...

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:46.620
<i>Ayane...</i>

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.720
<i>It's times like these that I 
need to be there for her.</i>

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:56.910
A-Ayane, the food here is... really...

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:00.700
Kurumi?

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:05.360
Idols...

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.520
You said you'd leave your wife!

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:18.280
You liar!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.040
What's going on?!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.470
I can't believe anything anymore!

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:25.430
No!

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:25.790
What happened to you, Kurumi?!

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:28.350
What's the meaning of this?!

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:29.810
Answer me!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.310
Chika, are you oka—

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:33.090
What did I do wrong?!

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:32.850
Miss Chika?

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:35.840
Shit!

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.840
S-S-S-Stop!

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.540
The restaurant will run out of food!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:46.420
What happened?! She usually eats so little!

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:49.640
I love it! The side of idols 
you never get to see! Nice!

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:53.520
So you really...

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:57.340
have no intention of leaving her, then?!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.640
What is this?! 
What's happening to everyone?!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:01.090
It can't be!

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:17.980
I-I-I'm so sorry for making 
a mess of your restaurant!

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.190
Hey, whoa!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:25.760
H-Hey, c'mon. Carmina doesn't 
need that kind of thing.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:29.370
We're trying to be like the nice, 
pure idols of the good old da—

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:30.930
Ow!

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.440
<b>PriConne</b>

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.440
Oh, boy...

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:38.520
This clearly isn't any kind of illness.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:53.600
Is that you... Pukichi?

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.200
Please...

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:00.600
Let me hear Pukichi's voice.

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:06.060
Ayane.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:12.480
Pukichi! It's you, isn't it?! I can tell!

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:13.310
Huh?!

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:16.400
I knew you'd figure it out, Ayane.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.190
This kind of thing really 
does feel great, huh?

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.990
You're the one who saved me earlier!

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:26.160
I could tell!

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:32.090
Excuse me, what the heck is going on here?

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.100
Oh, uh... right.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:38.350
She'll be able to explain 
it better than me.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.370
Take it away, little miss.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.900
Chika? Is that you?

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:57.760
I'm so sorry for that pitiful 
display, everyone...

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.940
Oh, gosh! What have I done?!

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:05.040
I'm so embarrassed, I don't 
know how I can go on living!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.410
Idol Chop!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.180
Meep...

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.250
Just relax, Chika.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.020
Don't try to take everything upon yourself.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.300
Nozomi...

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:25.690
What you see now is a brief return 
to my original self with Pukichi's help.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:31.670
I believe Kurumi is also under the 
influence of memory manipulation.

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:32.950
Memory manipulation?

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:36.230
Yes. Everything happening here...

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:40.440
is the work of Foggy, 
the great spirit of memories.

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:41.770
Foggy...

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:47.320
That's the mischievous spirit I've often 
seen mentioned in picture books.

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:52.390
Foggy can make you forget your 
memories and plant new ones in you.

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:56.560
It's probably having a good laugh 
watching us all struggle.

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:58.700
Yuuki...

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.470
I thought maybe you could get back

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:06.770
the memories you lost if you 
had Foggy's help, but now...

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.570
Please be careful, everyone.

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:14.990
There's no doubt that Foggy is out 
there somewhere, watching us.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:20.290
If we continue to let it roam free, 
terrible things will...

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.970
The seal...

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:25.440
The spring that houses the seal...

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:32.320
I heard my kids were in trouble!

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:34.790
So I was just some game to you?!

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.750
Kurumi, calm down!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:40.000
You said I was the only one you loved!

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.540
I'll kill you!

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:50.310
Excuse me! What do you think 
you're doing with a child?!

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:53.480
Please calm down, Miss Saren.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.810
Kokkoro?

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:56.320
<b>PriConne</b>

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:58.090
So that's it?

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:01.450
I'm sorry! I was sure that...

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:03.640
No problem! I'm just fine!

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:06.260
In fact, it was amazing!

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:07.210
The best.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:09.430
Goo, goo...

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:13.830
There, there. I'll make 
you some milk right now.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:23.590
Miss Pecorine and Miss Karyl are on 
their way to where Foggy was sealed.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:31.430
I'm sure the two of them can 
find a way to solve all this.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:33.600
Ow!

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.730
Karyl?

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:37.540
Ow, ow, ow...

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.680
Oh, no! Let me see your foot.

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:41.600
I'm fine!

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:44.730
Ow!

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.680
I can't let you overdo it.

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:51.610
Cut it out! We need to get 
to that spring in a hurry!

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:53.230
Come on, let's go!

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:03.380
<i>What's up with this pain?</i>

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.880
<i>I refuse to be a burden 
and slow everyone down.</i>

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:17.360
You're right. We don't 
have a moment to lose.

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:19.900
If we don't tend to that, it'll swell up!

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.630
Hey! This is embarrassing!

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:32.250
Cut it out! Let me down!

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:34.080
I will, I will.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.590
Once we're at the spring, you can get down 
and put that foot in the cold water.

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:45.580
You know...

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:50.930
With you, Karyl, I feel like I 
could keep running forever.

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.610
What are you talking about?

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:02.750
Dummy.

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:12.960
Honestly...

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:17.550
It's great that we made it to the 
spring where Foggy was sealed,

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:21.820
but you just never listen to me, do you?

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:25.140
Just look at you. A princess shouldn—

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:36.110
When we're like this, it almost 
feels like you're my older sister.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:44.120
Dummy. I don't want a little 
sister who's this much trouble.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:49.390
I guess Kokkoro would be our mom,
 since she's so responsible.

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:51.070
And Yuuki...

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:53.800
He'd obviously be the youngest brother.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:07.540
Okay, that should do it.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:10.220
Be more careful, all right?

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.060
Okay!

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:15.780
Anyway, I don't see anything that 
could give us any hints at all.

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:17.560
What to do?

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.770
What a pretty bird.

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:29.330
I bet that feels nice.

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:37.440
Is that...?

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:43.420
There, there...

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.010
Welcome!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.570
Hey, you new here?

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.120
I'm just a temp.

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:52.620
Nice, nice! Can't complain 
about an extra bonus!

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:53.750
Will you be ordering?

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:57.150
I'll just take a smile from you! I love it!

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:01.980
Now she's acting like a baby.

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:05.230
Foggy is nearby for sure.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:11.730
I had no idea you were doing something 
so dangerous alone, all for Yuuki.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:15.540
I'm sorry I never realized...

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:21.930
Hurt? You hurt?

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:27.320
Sorry, Chika.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:30.890
This is no time for me 
to lose heart, is it?

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.780
I'll get you back to normal, I promise.

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:37.000
Once I do, let's sing together!

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:42.370
Carmina is only the trio of singing, dancing,

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:45.220
fighting idols when we're 
all together, after all.

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:03.400
Pukichi?!

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.170
Miss Karyl!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.850
I've finally got you!

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:17.880
Now, show yourself,

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:20.380
Foggy, great spirit of memories!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.370
Pecorine!

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:30.360
Right!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.600
Here I go!

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:35.860
Princess Strike!

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:41.650
She got it!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:44.980
Chika?

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:45.970
Be careful!

00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:48.600
Physical attacks don't work on spirits!

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:53.950
Peco!

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:17.320
Yuuki! Yuuki!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.610
Yuuki, listen to me!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:31.460
Here you go. With a little extra.

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:32.290
Thank you!

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:35.980
C'mon, this way!

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.220
Wait up!

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:40.140
What're you just standing in a daze for?

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:44.230
Are you ready to go to the Sol Tower?

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.810
The Sol... Tower?

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:49.370
Sorry we're late!

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:50.870
Sorry about that.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:53.360
We did what Hiyori wanted 
to do and ran late.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.170
Aw, c'mon.

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:58.730
Here you go. It's warm and tasty!

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:07.120
I guess it's time, right, everyone?

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:27.400
Yeah. We have plenty of orbs.

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:30.890
To the top of the tower we go!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:31.820
Yeah!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:33.260
Go, go!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:38.680
To make our dream come true!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.550
Are you okay, Yuuki?

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:56.720
Yeah. Let's go.

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:07.440
Wow... Now we can...

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:19.800
<i>Spirits of wind, inhabit this song...</i>

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:31.830
<i>Soul cloaked in the blue sky's 
protection, join us...</i>

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:27.030
That's Chika's song.

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:30.630
The song of Chika's that I love so much!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:41.720
Nozomi, do it! Now's your chance!

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.070
Okay!

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:45.140
You'll pay for doing that to Chika!

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:48.090
This is what it means to be singing, 
dancing, fighting idols!

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.510
Come one, come all!

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:14.050
Who wants some delicious lemonade?

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:16.540
C-Come on over.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.750
No, no! You gotta be as 
loud as you were earlier!

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:24.650
Th-That was just from a memory of something 
I saw in a book on Mama Saren's bookshelf...

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:27.870
What kind of bookshelf 
would that have to be?

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:29.770
Sure makes you curious, doesn't it?

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:33.340
We've successfully sealed Foggy.

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:35.570
Thank you so much.

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:38.300
We gotta help each other 
in times of trouble!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:39.540
That's how it goes!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:42.060
Right!

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:49.580
Tell Tsumugi we said hello!

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:54.530
I'm glad everyone is back to normal.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.970
Menu 8<b>  A Letter to Join Feelings 
~Arancini on the Green Hill~</b>
